Collect Symptom Report from CU
    [Arguments]    ${bts_id}=${0}    ${log_dir}=${None}    ${timeout}=${180}
    [Documentation]    Save and download symptomreport.zip file to log directory on the local machine.
    ...    :param bts_id:     Id of bts from which the symptom report will be collected
    ...    :param log_dir:    Directory where report will be collected
    ...    :param timeout:    Timeout for the operation
