    ...     :param file_path:     Path to the CU's commissioning file in XML format.
    ...     :param except_ongoing_operation: set to 1 if you want to except test failure due to ongoing operation
    ...     :param bts_id: BTS id - related to Test Line configuration
    gnbcu.activate_cu_configuration    file_path=${file_path}    except_ongoing_operation=${except_ongoing_operation}
    ...    bts_id=${bts_id}

Activate Planned CU Configuration
    [Arguments]     ${plan_id}    ${bts_id}=${0}
    [Documentation]    Perform gNB CU commissioning without plan validation. Use one of SCFs already uploaded to CU.
    ...     :param plan_id:     ID of one of the plans already uploaded to CU, which is going to be activated.
    ...     :param bts_id: BTS id - related to Test Line configuration
